      "sourceText": "`new/delete` 能手动管理动态内存，但它要求你在所有路径上都记得释放资源。一旦函数提前 `return`、抛异常，或者多个对象互相持有指针，就很容易出现内存泄漏、重复释放、悬空指针。",
      "translatedText": "`new/delete`You can manually manage dynamic memory, but it requires you to remember to release resources on all paths\\. Once a function returns early,`return` throws an exception, or multiple objects hold pointers to each other, memory leaks, double frees, and dangling pointers easily occur\\.",
