      "translatedText": "The Nav2 project inherits from the ROS Navigation Stack\\. The project aims to enable a mobile robot to safely move from point A to point B\\. It can also be applied to other applications involving robot navigation, such as following dynamic points\\. Nav2 will be used to implement a series of functions including path planning, motion control, dynamic obstacle avoidance, and recovery behaviors\\.",
